capability schema/coordinates  a schema coordinate (`Type.field(arg:)`) read and resolved
  heroes  pending
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  graphql.parse_schema_coordinate, graphql.resolve_schema_coordinate, graphql.resolve_ast_schema_coordinate, ResolvedSchemaElement, ResolvedNamedType, ResolvedField, ResolvedFieldArgument, ResolvedInputField, ResolvedEnumValue, ResolvedDirective, ResolvedDirectiveArgument
