capability execute/federation  the Apollo Federation's entities and service queries
  heroes  refused: Apollo Federation is Apollo's, not the specification's
  go      gqlgen graphql.FederationRequiresForBatch
  rust    async-graphql types::Any
  python  strawberry.federation

capability execute/relay  Relay's connections, edges and cursors
  heroes  refused: Relay's connections are a convention a schema writes in its own text, `PageInfo` and edges as types; nothing in execution changes
  go      -
  rust    async-graphql types::connection (Connection, Edge, PageInfo, OpaqueCursor, CursorType, query, query_with, the name types)
  python  strawberry.relay

